<h1 local-id=3D"bf93fd1d8427" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-Overview">Ove=
rview</h1>
<p local-id=3D"9cfb67cc9c1c">This page is a combination of the product requ=
irements and the tech stack for the Agentic AI layer on top of the Operatio=
ns Software.</p>
<p local-id=3D"00e768d339db">The goal is to have a Conversational layer ove=
r the dashboard, that also anticipates shortages.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e73be1a12f71">
<li local-id=3D"7b5bd9464810">
<p local-id=3D"f3fe5d166e57">An agentic AI chatbot in the existing&nbsp;<co=
de>erp/ui</code>&nbsp;dashboard.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f502b1ff2a21">
<p local-id=3D"cd6a3d77f712">Natural-language Q&amp;A over inventory, MES, =
supply-chain, and test data via the existing&nbsp;<code>erp/api</code>&nbsp=
;aggregator.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"504bba07af99">
<p local-id=3D"c5327b584b5d">Renders charts, tables, and suggestion cards i=
nline as the model streams.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d74922722b0e">
<p local-id=3D"002c43ecceb5">Surfaces parts that will short upcoming builds=
 before the operator finds out at the bin. Strictly read-only; every action=
 recommendation is a link or a draft handoff to a human operator.</p></li>
</ul>
