<h2 local-id=3D"770dc08e7752" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-Decision/Stat=
usLog">Decision/ Status Log</h2>
<p local-id=3D"b9117b3f6999">This log describes the decisions taken simulta=
neously during development based on the current requirements.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"8c65997a9c38" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-MVPArchitectu=
reReviewwithTommy">MVP Architecture Review with Tommy</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"9dc6924f9b0c">
<li local-id=3D"3f24e77fcee4">
<p local-id=3D"5895d769ba5d">Plan Approved</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9e0c5880148">
<p local-id=3D"182a631fd91b">Shortage Analyzer is a must for 6/23 Demo - us=
e mock data if historical data is not present</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7bc0cc107918">
<p local-id=3D"3d498ca46650">Deferred Shortage Analyzer - need to work with=
 real data</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"d07f32bcbca9" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-MVPArchitectu=
reReviewwithMax(InfoSec)">MVP Architecture Review with Max (InfoSec)</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"26c7a48d468d">
<li local-id=3D"d13eb41158cb">
<p local-id=3D"26c6a3040774">Plan Approved to start Development</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0addfa794981">
<p local-id=3D"7f941ec301cb">On going process of deciding inference solutio=
ns:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b5b2fea448db">
<li local-id=3D"a9cafcab0fc8">
<p local-id=3D"d2f6cf320536">Max is researching and figuring out local infe=
rence solutions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"976a31fcc77d">
<p local-id=3D"7f24c5e6d070">Darshan suggests using Anthropic/ Copilot API =
keys from existing enterprise contracts to avoid setting up temporary contr=
act with third part providers (Together AI)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"84d29732c3a9">
<p local-id=3D"c8b78978c132"><strong>Update: </strong>Using Anthropic API f=
or MVP</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"53136d6e377e" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-ServerRuntime=
Update">Server Runtime Update</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"13bb1d8d9138">
<li local-id=3D"f5edb15ef843">
<p local-id=3D"cf4c1d63c2fb">Moving from Bun to Node</p>
<ul local-id=3D"35926fa40305">
<li local-id=3D"93cdade482ee">
<p local-id=3D"ca96ad093cb7">Better production stability by avoiding possib=
le incompatibilities with existing ERP UI</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eeaa17fc5ca6">
<p local-id=3D"98ffed2e3512">Match ERP UI=E2=80=99s package manager with NP=
M</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2fcb40cdc53a"></p>
