<h3 local-id=3D"34c206071391" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-AuthFlow">Aut=
h Flow</h3><a data-card-appearance=3D"embed" data-layout=3D"wide" data-widt=
h=3D"100.00" href=3D"https://amperesand.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SD/whiteb=
oard/414548377" local-id=3D"eecd2a34179c" rel=3D"nofollow">https://amperesa=
nd.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SD/whiteboard/414548377</a>
<p local-id=3D"6b182e6ddbdd"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"fa00a332441f" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-SidecarvsEmbe=
d">Sidecar vs Embed</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f4712f4daed7"></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"ba=
2e0332-a6e8-49c5-a970-7caae9edff5d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"70fc0f1ce9a3">
<th data-local-id=3D"a4421f671cc9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b3eee79e1c07"><strong>Sidecar (TS) - Picked</strong></p></th=
>
<th data-local-id=3D"eee1484fa69f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ca5974466d93"><strong>Embed in existing service (Go)</strong=
></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5a18267f389e">
<td data-local-id=3D"0629340a62b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f21ed5769d48">+ Matches erp/ui + AI SDK ecosystem natively</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1ca52f270687" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7b29f4ca844">=E2=88=92 No first-class agent framework in Go=
 in 2026</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9533cb5d0752">
<td data-local-id=3D"8b4875201f52" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4575fc024bfe">+ Shared Zod schemas (sidecar tool defs =E2=86=
=94 UI render)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"183b08c28989" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"576cb3a6fd5b">=E2=88=92 Forces hand-roll of tool-loop + stre=
aming + cache</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a1c5e4ccfcb5">
<td data-local-id=3D"b83a78fe389b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1e821c6f5e93">+ Independent deploy/scale/restart cadence</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"48375ec4f67b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd73e768ce6f">=E2=88=92 Less LLM tooling community (gateways=
, evals, RAG are TS/Py first)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1df48969cbd0">
<td data-local-id=3D"31aabf4dea60" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"16395005c6d7">+ Different language without polluting Go serv=
ice tree</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9231795b71c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f32f72737c0">=E2=88=92 Couples LLM scale to inventory traff=
ic</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"507d92b2315a">
<td data-local-id=3D"4587dbd63a9f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5bf6487dfaf6">+ Egress controls limited to one pod</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dddc38c3d2c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"745ce4c5a692">=E2=88=92 Framework pivot requires full servic=
e refactor</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"94df87cf93c3">
<td data-local-id=3D"91c5ab2c13e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b72d371f3cc3">+ Trace storage in dedicated CH table</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5b5971d3678e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"70e232bfe685"></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2600665d4a35">
<td data-local-id=3D"f4146b309cbf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f4e58ebb48b4">+ Mastra/AI SDK/json-render TS-native</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8aeacab41190" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"319854b75a97"></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"b870a14c4e69"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c7d1fbeab8e1" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-TechStack">Te=
ch Stack</h2>
<h2 local-id=3D"13472039551d" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-1.Models">1. =
Models</h2>
<p local-id=3D"31c6bca298eb">We will strictly go with open-weight models. <=
strong>Reason</strong> - Have complete control of data and the ability to f=
ine-tune the model based on our use case in the future, while maintaining d=
rastically lower token costs.</p>
<p local-id=3D"981efd648c33"><strong>Note</strong>: Models are subject to c=
hange as we experiment in the initial stages.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"561e5335e11a">
<li local-id=3D"30d534bbe862">
<p local-id=3D"9d2dbe61263c">Orchestrator Model</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9baccbc5e767">
<li local-id=3D"423eba3debf1">
<p local-id=3D"5d8e497428c4"><strong>Qwen3.6-27B</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ca78d7a542ac">
<li local-id=3D"c53aee8308fd">
<p local-id=3D"24c0687311d6">New Qwen dense flagship. Reportedly beats prio=
r 397B MoE on agentic coding + Spider/BIRD SQL at much lower cost. Apache 2=
.0 keeps fine-tune + redistribute path open. 256k+ context fits schema doc =
+ 30-turn history. Tool-use leader among open weights, Qwen native tool-cal=
l template most battle-tested across 3.5/3.6 line. Switch trigger: Phase 0 =
eval shows 27B underperforms =E2=86=92 Qwen3.5-397B-A17B Thinking or Mistra=
l Large 3.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"af6caa3ef12f">
<p local-id=3D"6129f4cb12a0">Runner ups - Qwen3.5-397B-A17B, Gemma 4 31B, L=
lama 4 Maverick, Mistral Large 3</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fb3fb38dc22">
<p local-id=3D"6530abd48705">Cheap Subtask Model</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3dfabf076f2c">
<li local-id=3D"b18731a48ee8">
<p local-id=3D"17c486dde8f6"><strong>Qwen3.6-35B-A3B</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"cd1fa5516bfa">
<li local-id=3D"89e7babfbf84">
<p local-id=3D"572635e44844">MoE with only 3B active params. Sub-$0.20/MTok=
 on managed providers. Routing, title generation, suggestion-card body reph=
rasing, sanity-check passes ("does this row count look reasonable?"). Stayi=
ng in Qwen family enables single LoRA targeting both with appropriate base-=
merge.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b70be1303d8">
<p local-id=3D"5e428c626589">Runner ups - Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma 4 E4B, Llama 4 =
Scout on Groq</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3d92cb7373b3">
<p local-id=3D"40f811c04959">Heavy Reasoning Escape Hatch</p>
<ul local-id=3D"14f79797c5b3">
<li local-id=3D"8eaed05e3195">
<p local-id=3D"23aa6d5a9489"><strong>Deepseek R1</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"933c0c6fdef4">
<li local-id=3D"e704b7f6009a">
<p local-id=3D"1651e3bc533c">Reserve for &lt;5% turns: shortage root-cause =
"explain" mode, multi-step planning. Hard-cap thinking tokens at 4k to boun=
d cost. Thinking tokens count as output (expensive). MIT, most permissive l=
icense.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b110603dc04">
<p local-id=3D"da29fa145247">Runner Ups - Qwen3.5-397B-A17B Thinking, DeepS=
eek-V4-Pro</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fff998d01685"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"0ac45dda0eaf" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-2.InferencePr=
ovider">2. Inference Provider</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d176ef9a2425">We choose a provider that has the most complia=
nce certifications, has zero data retention, OpenAI compatible API, while p=
roviding the highest number of open-weight models available.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c5a2489215da">
<li local-id=3D"1add63ba8012">
<p local-id=3D"9e4816ee214a">Pick - <strong>Together AI</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8d8986b09caa">
<li local-id=3D"f2bc4e999fd4">
<p local-id=3D"24d4324cca68">Broadest open-weight catalog: Qwen 3.5/3.6 (in=
cl. Coder), DeepSeek V3/V4, Llama 4 Scout+Maverick, Gemma 4, Mistral Large =
3, plus 200+. First-party LoRA fine-tune endpoint + Serverless Multi-LoRA (=
production since Dec 2024) =3D Phase 3+ path of least resistance. OpenAI-co=
mpatible API =E2=86=92 drop-in behind LiteLLM. SOC2 + zero data retention o=
n enterprise tier</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"1fb19abe13f3">
<p local-id=3D"9b64b7fbf402">Runner ups - <strong>Fireworks AI</strong>, De=
epInfra, OpenRouter, Groq, Cerebras, Self-host (vLLM/SGLang)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a74e7c57d7a7"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"da5f72531f51" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-3.AgentFramew=
ork">3. Agent Framework</h3>
<p local-id=3D"895c76179edc">Pick - <strong>Mastra</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"531e22072c51">
<li local-id=3D"821e4c7cffee">
<p local-id=3D"cae7733d8c80">TS-native, v1.0 stable. Bundled DX: agents + w=
orkflows + RAG + evals + observability + Mastra Studio local UI without ass=
embling 5 libraries. Sits on Vercel AI SDK underneath for provider abstract=
ion. Zod-everywhere ergonomics, schemas shared sidecar =E2=86=94 UI. First-=
class bidirectional MCP (both stdio + HTTP transports; Studio renders MCP t=
imeline spans). Production users: Replit, PayPal, Sanity, Brex, SoftBank. S=
witch triggers: ADK if multi-agent topology becomes central or Vertex Agent=
 Engine; LangGraph if flow becomes complex stateful DAG; Pydantic AI if tea=
m goes Python for v2 forecasting.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"563961cc75b5">
<p local-id=3D"ba16a2d35647">Runner ups - Google ADK TS 1.0, LangGraph.js, =
Pydantic AI, Vercel AI SDK</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9bb7d041a84f"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"a27ae12cbafe" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-4.SidecarLang=
uage">4. Sidecar Language</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ec12cea7e793">Pick - <strong>TypeScript (Node + Hono)</stron=
g></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b12ee7e36942">
<li local-id=3D"8ead70e533cb">
<p local-id=3D"0ee8ec98976f">Same language as erp/ui (React/TS). Shared Zod=
 schemas for chart/table/card envelopes eliminate integration bugs. No firs=
t-class Go agent framework in 2026.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14dbc4d8d47e">
<p local-id=3D"ad3dfd747107">Runner ups - Python (FastAPI + Pydantic AI), G=
o (in inventory-service)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"777480b5190f"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"2541c12e40c3" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-5.LLMGateway"=
>5. LLM Gateway</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d90cc0bb7307">Pick - <strong>LiteLLM Proxy (self-hosted)</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4ab4ffe5d15a">
<li local-id=3D"37b600fe3420">
<p local-id=3D"b436ead4e135">OpenAI-compat in, any provider out. Virtual ke=
ys per user =E2=86=92 budgets + rate limits. Fallback chain: Together =E2=
=86=92 Fireworks =E2=86=92 DeepInfra =E2=86=92 GPT-5-mini (last-resort clos=
ed). MCP Gateway with team/key-scoped tool access, A2A Agent Gateway, Agent=
 Hub, /v1/memory CRUD. Single config change swaps Qwen =E2=86=92 DeepSeek =
=E2=86=92 fine-tuned LoRA without app code change. Per-turn model routing: =
app requests virtual model `agent-orchestrator`; gateway resolves to curren=
t production model.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c3425614f889">
<p local-id=3D"7bec62ea6fff">Runner ups - Portkey, OpenRouter direct, Helic=
one (gateway + observability combined)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a6b42e82b2d9"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"29b158acc5e9" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-6.Conversatio=
nMemory+Traces">6. Conversation Memory + Traces</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5535b265fb79">Pick - <strong> Postgres (JSONB) + Clickhouse<=
/strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e8b1bdf2b115">
<li local-id=3D"ae11227d0d5a">
<p local-id=3D"344bace5e3fe">Postgres for conversation history + pinned fac=
ts (low write rate, JSON queryable, durability matters, no LRU eviction on =
slow weeks). ClickHouse for agent_traces (high write rate, analytical queri=
es for cost dashboards). Avoids framework lock-in, swap orchestrator withou=
t losing chat history. Mastra Memory abstraction available but back it with=
 our Postgres.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8649c47d82cb">
<p local-id=3D"89e9bfa032fc">Runner ups - LangGraph Checkpointer, Redis, Ma=
stra Memory</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9343308e68b7"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"c770762e4c9f" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-7.Observabili=
ty">7. Observability</h3>
<p local-id=3D"89eeb66d4f6f">Pick - Langfuse (self-host)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"19f883d4d001">
<li local-id=3D"05af78baa4ec">
<p local-id=3D"99273546eee2">Apache-2.0 self-host (Docker / Helm) alongside=
 inventory-service. OTel GenAI semconv =E2=86=92 Mastra =E2=86=92 OTel =E2=
=86=92 Langfuse "just works". If we switch framework, traces still flow. Na=
tive cost computation per model. Eval datasets backed by traces. Prompt man=
agement with versioning.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cae8de82853d">
<p local-id=3D"aa5794e9d712">Runner ups - Helicone, LangSmith, Arize Phoeni=
x, Braintrust</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c4a0ff3d4cf0"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"c831e12661ea" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-8.EvalHarness=
">8. Eval Harness</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c533707453d9">We stick with Langfuse Evals to start with. Up=
grade to Promptfoo (CI) + Langfuse datasets (prod) when needed</p>
<p local-id=3D"321401a2927a"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"491d3d564bdd" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-CostEstimates=
">Cost Estimates</h2>
<p local-id=3D"e23843c90025"><strong>Assumptions:</strong> 50 active users =
=C3=97 10 turns/day =3D 500 turns/day =3D ~15k turns/month. 70% orchestrato=
r (Qwen3.6-27B) =C2=B7 25% cheap (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B) =C2=B7 5% reasoner (Deep=
Seek-R1).</p>
