</div>
<p local-id=3D"76015c55a02e"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"96e5adf1dbf1" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-CostGuardrail=
s">Cost Guardrails</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7af730f8-e185-434d-a855-c3a54ac4c135">
<li local-id=3D"5e39f342-5441-44f5-968e-d9e96fe1e1bf">
<p local-id=3D"e609533c2653">LiteLLM virtual keys =C2=B7 per-user daily bud=
get cap</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"65e21d52-2cbc-4f7e-be46-4843d2c78f55">
<p local-id=3D"98ae8a2ef15b">Rate limit: 60 turns/hr =C2=B7 500 turns/day p=
er user</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c76bc0be-ec7d-45de-96fa-12f07ba83c02">
<p local-id=3D"6aa065c06c82">Cheap router (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B) on lookup / tit=
le turns</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e30b6175-e6f4-47ff-b41a-3b13c049e546">
<p local-id=3D"98c3ac13e2e8">Heavy tier (DeepSeek-R1) hard-capped at 4k thi=
nking tokens =C2=B7 &lt;5% of turns</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"812765cb296f">
<p local-id=3D"ce8f50b4a53b">Prompt caching saving token cost - avoids feed=
ing system prompt on every request.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e2db8e1-9730-4867-9b15-dbc24b25fd1d">
<p local-id=3D"da127b5ab790">LangFuse cost dashboard =C2=B7 per-model accur=
acy</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c5931b482b4a"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"d9eea3f40781" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-KeyDecisions+=
Security:">Key Decisions + Security:</h2>
<p local-id=3D"aa780ef36e80"><a data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"htt=
ps://amperesand.atlassian.net/wiki/x/PgMmGQ" local-id=3D"835203588c3c" rel=
=3D"nofollow">https://amperesand.atlassian.net/wiki/x/PgMmGQ</a></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d91f75d4-4726-4047-9c44-788a02c946d6">
<li local-id=3D"40790cae-9b1e-4337-82ce-fd7ef2386bd7">
<p local-id=3D"7f49d32bf106">Architectural read-only</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ac53982b-a143-4134-a8c4-edcd77cfa378">
<li local-id=3D"93d73d6d-15bf-4f6a-981d-807a8dc2e59e">
<p local-id=3D"da75ff1bd561">Sidecar holds&nbsp;<code>ai-readonly</code>&nb=
sp;BasicAuth user.&nbsp;<code>aiReadOnlyGuard</code>&nbsp;middleware in&nbs=
p;<code>server.go</code>&nbsp;rejects all non-<code>GET</code>&nbsp;+ Graph=
QL mutations for this principal. Even if model is prompt-injected to "DELET=
E", aggregator drops it at the edge.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38ad0575-cfc3-4078-b66b-c3beaa9ecf30">
<p local-id=3D"e2991437af9c">No write tools registered. No SQL surface in v=
1. Tool outputs wrapped in&nbsp;<code>&lt;tool_result&gt;</code>&nbsp;tags =
- model treats as data.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"2c1a550a-b83a-4d51-81f1-6df284a456de">
<p local-id=3D"2742fab106c7">Two outbound destinations</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6967cb36-5b96-42fa-82d6-34a63cbcc217">
<li local-id=3D"028a5208-2e87-405c-8949-c831d9ff415c">
<p local-id=3D"ec39e792ded9">Sidecar pod egress restricted via NetworkPolic=
y to&nbsp;<code>:8090</code>&nbsp;(aggregator) and LiteLLM only. No direct =
CH driver, no NATS client, no Airtable PAT in sidecar pod. Defense in depth=
.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"bbf3d610-fff3-4db0-8938-e30f57e57109">
<p local-id=3D"2506187db8a9">SSE end-to-end</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1f4727eb-7a7c-4659-9ccd-498c4430e414">
<li local-id=3D"f4ea436d-9556-41de-bdb6-fa2e96af74ba">
<p local-id=3D"1ee004b370ad">Token streaming UI =E2=86=94 aggregator =E2=86=
=94 sidecar =E2=86=94 provider. Aggregator's&nbsp;<code>ReverseProxy.FlushI=
nterval=3D-1</code>&nbsp;ensures no buffering.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3c16b189c991"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"196ecba83bc2" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-ThreatModel.v=
1">Threat Model . v1</h3>
<p local-id=3D"eb50d1b5a0c0"></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"34=
c13d94" data-table-display-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"55b0e824">
<th data-local-id=3D"8b206261d312" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3c093a4afda8"><strong>THREAT</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"40ff8c1d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1126a25d"><strong>MITIGATION</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3829f0fd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"65264ba7"><strong>RESIDUAL</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"711ac179">
<td data-local-id=3D"65122d14" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"117c0380">Prompt injection via Airtable text notes</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"32cf84dc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2411822d">&lt;tool_result&gt; delimiters =C2=B7 regex deny-l=
ist =C2=B7 model never executes user-supplied SQL =C2=B7 adversarial Prompt=
foo eval</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1655c981" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d14948a">Low</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"14f3e103">
<td data-local-id=3D"52991c42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e4e1d6b">Model emits write call</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"470d6196" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"18f88972">Aggregator denies non-GET for ai-readonly ; sideca=
r has no write tools</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3143f850" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74b15e44">Negligible</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"22d977c8">
<td data-local-id=3D"073e360c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7af3ca1c">S<span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D=
"72527698-3744-424d-bc60-6cd1c038c874">QL injection</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"60956d00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"158f7a9e">v1: no SQL surface. v1.5 MCP: AST validator + EXPL=
AIN gate + ai_readonly CH role</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7760bf94" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4992091f">Low</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6189da57">
<td data-local-id=3D"1d8f9387" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1417bc5c">Data exfil via LLM provider</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d0ac48d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ce6a416">Provider must offer SOC2 + zero-retention + no-tra=
ining agreement. Together / Fireworks / DeepInfra qualify (HIPAA req: confi=
rm with sales)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"74a270b4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1cb94571">Medium</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"41d183e8">
<td data-local-id=3D"6a67fc5f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d5f9579"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"=
369b104b-6d39-41b6-9c14-c87d6a4ae93a">PII in prompts</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41651519" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47224bfe">Operator names mapped to opaque IDs pre-model</p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7d7e8526" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d4ec3f1">Low</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"38b4ea5b">
<td data-local-id=3D"2509cb22" class=3D"confluenceTd">
