</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"66a1de40c683"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6e9dda991477" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-DeferredfromM=
VP-">Deferred from MVP - <time datetime=3D"2026-06-23" class=3D"date-past">=
23 Jun 2026</time></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"e8986408f29b">
<li local-id=3D"dd7f429a351d">
<p local-id=3D"a4f84332d56f">Generative UI - implement if time permits</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"95d8c7d0eb33">
<p local-id=3D"b3979e196c21">LiteLLM proxy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a31ddfd4a721">
<p local-id=3D"3680c166c190">Langfuse Observability + Evals</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0b348f3bcbdb"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bbc5c834c234" id=3D"AIInfra(ReviewInProgress)-V2+Features">=
V2+ Features</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"fb01ef960493">
<li local-id=3D"48b250fb9950">
<p local-id=3D"8ae4a782f3d4">User based Personas</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"545a07b5a6ca">Based on who the user is (Engineer/Operator/Ma=
nager), the agent should reply with the appropriate data that would be idea=
l for that person to know.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b157802cff1e">Data governance based on the user - some users=
 don't have the authorization to know certain data.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5348f7f83212">Possible after SSO + RBAC is in place.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d7d4f9fbe0be">
<li local-id=3D"d8ccd8639284">
<p local-id=3D"37ad4767ef12">Compliance RAG module/ Critic Agent</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e4aacebe4f76">Assess what information the LLM is retrieving =
before outputting it to the user. Prevent PII, sensitive information leak. =
Possibly have ideal data metrics knowledge base so that the agent knows if =
the data coming from the API is not right.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"82c95af856ef">
<li local-id=3D"7dee7adb7ee0">
<p local-id=3D"32fddca68c11">Usage alerts</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"81699c12a4e3">Notify users about the percentage of usage the=
y have left based on the cost guardrails set in LiteLLM proxy.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"cf414d3bcf03">
<li local-id=3D"3db8e6b68e56">
<p local-id=3D"1ccadfc5ac62">Adaptive Learning Framework</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"015e63222166">A learning mode that can be used by admins to =
set new rules just by talking to the agent and going through normal process=
 loops.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3efffc8ac78d">
<li local-id=3D"af0a58636f31">
<p local-id=3D"94c85599e660">Speech-to-Speech</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9393f9a611e8">Realtime voice IO to make it as seamless inter=
active experience.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7225f84d1fdb"></p>
<p local-id=3D"6b61c27a9b24"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
